```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

  <title>My gallary tour 🎀</title>

  <style>
    body {
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ffe6f2, #fff0f7);
      text-align: center;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 30px 15px;
      color: #7a3155;
    }

    h1 {
      color: #e75491;
      font-size: 38px;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }

    .hearts {
      font-size: 24px;
      letter-spacing: 8px;
      margin-bottom: 15px;
    }

    .intro {
      color: #a64d73;
      font-size: 17px;
      margin-bottom: 30px;
    }

    .gallery {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr));
      gap: 22px;
      max-width: 1000px;
      margin: auto;
    }

    .photo {
      background: white;
      padding: 10px;
      border-radius: 20px;
      box-shadow: 0 6px 18px rgba(231, 84, 145, 0.2);
    }

    .photo img {
      width: 100%;
      height: 260px;
      object-fit: cover;
      border-radius: 15px;
      display: block;
    }

    footer {
      margin-top: 40px;
      color: #d65a8a;
      font-size: 15px;
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>

  <div class="hearts">♡ 🎀 ♡ 🎀 ♡</div>

  <h1>My Photo Gallery 🎀</h1>

  <p class="intro">
    A little collection of my favourite memories 💕
  </p>

  <div class="gallery">

    <div class="photo">
      <img src="photo1.jpg" alt="Photo 1">
    </div>

    <div class="photo">
      <img src="photo2.jpg" alt="Photo 2">
    </div>

    <div class="photo">
      <img src="photo3.jpg" alt="Photo 3">
    </div>

    <div class="photo">
      <img src="photo4.jpg" alt="Photo 4">
    </div>

  </div>

  <footer>
    Made with love ♡ 🎀
  </footer>

</body>
</html>
```
